WEBVTT

00:00:20.896 --> 00:00:21.766
[ALL CHEERING]

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:23.551
[LAUGHING]

00:00:23.725 --> 00:00:26.032
You feel me now?
That's my girlfriend, suckers.

00:00:26.206 --> 00:00:27.468
Your wife, Johnny.

00:00:27.642 --> 00:00:29.687
My wife. Even better.

00:00:29.861 --> 00:00:32.908
That was sick, lady.
Where did you learn
how to do that stuff?

00:00:33.082 --> 00:00:34.475
Transylvania.

00:00:34.649 --> 00:00:37.695
That's cool.
I have a cousin
from Pennsylvania.

00:00:37.869 --> 00:00:41.482
Oh. These little
guys are so sweet.
Dennis would love them.

00:00:41.656 --> 00:00:43.223
What an awesome
place to raise a kid.

00:00:43.397 --> 00:00:45.138
Oh. To raise a kid?

00:00:45.312 --> 00:00:47.096
I don't know about awesome.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:50.230
Maybe tubular. Capisce?

00:00:50.404 --> 00:00:51.970
Anyways, we should
hit my folks' place.

00:00:52.145 --> 00:00:52.841
I said we'd be there by now.

00:00:53.015 --> 00:00:54.408
Sure.

00:00:54.582 --> 00:00:56.497
Oh, hey, it's after
3:00 in Transylvania.

00:00:56.671 --> 00:00:58.542
I'm gonna check
on Dennis, okay?

00:01:03.591 --> 00:01:06.333
Chocolate cereal.
Are you kidding me?

00:01:06.507 --> 00:01:08.509
It's okay, Drac.
It's 'cause they love us.

00:01:08.683 --> 00:01:11.033
Yeah.
Monsters are what's goin' on.

00:01:11.207 --> 00:01:13.209
GRIFFIN: Oh, yeah.
You should
embrace it like I did.

00:01:13.383 --> 00:01:15.211
I've got
a best-selling workout video.

00:01:15.385 --> 00:01:17.909
Follow me, ladies.
Right. And left.

00:01:18.084 --> 00:01:20.651
No, girls. Watch me.
You're not watching.

00:01:20.825 --> 00:01:23.654
Here we go. And eight
and seven and six...

00:01:23.828 --> 00:01:26.004
That's not me, guys.

00:01:26.179 --> 00:01:28.877
Come on,
even Bigfoot's tearin' it up
in the German soccer league.

00:01:29.051 --> 00:01:30.444
[COMMENTATOR SPEAKING GERMAN] [AUDIENCE CHEERING]

00:01:36.928 --> 00:01:38.452
[CELL PHONE RINGING]Oh, no. Oh, no, no, no.

00:01:39.235 --> 00:01:40.845
It's Mavis.

00:01:41.019 --> 00:01:42.630
You gotta answer it.

00:01:42.804 --> 00:01:44.197
You're pushin' too hard.
Lighter.

00:01:44.371 --> 00:01:46.373
All right!

00:01:46.547 --> 00:01:49.332
Denisovich, wake up.
Oh, boy, he's out cold.

00:01:49.506 --> 00:01:50.594
GRIFFIN: I got this.

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:54.555
Dad, what took so long?

00:01:54.729 --> 00:01:56.513
What?

00:01:56.687 --> 00:01:59.299
Nothing, Mavey.
We're all great
here at the hotel.

00:01:59.473 --> 00:02:01.388
Just doing hotel things.

00:02:01.562 --> 00:02:02.693
Sorry,
can't handle your breath.

00:02:02.867 --> 00:02:04.260
I hear ya.

00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:05.827
How are you?

00:02:06.001 --> 00:02:08.221
We're having a blast.

00:02:08.395 --> 00:02:10.571
We just went
biking and mini-marting.
It's so fun here.

00:02:11.398 --> 00:02:12.747
Is Dennis okay?

00:02:12.921 --> 00:02:14.009
Oh. Of course.

00:02:14.183 --> 00:02:15.837
You want to see him?

00:02:16.011 --> 00:02:17.752
Yes. Yes, I do.

00:02:17.926 --> 00:02:19.057
Hi, baby. How are you?

00:02:19.232 --> 00:02:20.755
GRIFFIN: Mommy.

00:02:20.929 --> 00:02:21.582
I happy. [CHUCKLES]

00:02:22.365 --> 00:02:23.410
Aw.

00:02:23.584 --> 00:02:25.151
Hey, little dude.

00:02:25.325 --> 00:02:26.804
Why is he wearing sunglasses?

00:02:26.978 --> 00:02:28.937
Oh, we were playing.

00:02:29.111 --> 00:02:31.766
It's a superhero thing.

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:35.291
GRIFFIN: Cebause,
I'm Sunglasses Man,
to the rescue!

00:02:35.465 --> 00:02:36.901
Okay, take it down a notch. I'm flying.

00:02:37.075 --> 00:02:39.600
You sound funny.

00:02:39.774 --> 00:02:42.733
Oh, no, no, that's his
Sunglasses Man voice.

00:02:42.907 --> 00:02:45.562
[VOCALIZES] Static.
The signal is bad.
Mavis, are you there?

00:02:47.129 --> 00:02:47.912
MAVIS: Yeah, I'm still...

00:02:49.262 --> 00:02:51.873
All right.
I guess he's having fun.

00:02:52.047 --> 00:02:53.701
Of course he is. [CHUCKLES]

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:58.009
GRIFFIN: Wow, I nailed it
with the Sunglasses Man.

00:02:58.184 --> 00:02:59.663
Right off the top of my head.

00:02:59.837 --> 00:03:01.752
I threw in a "cebause."
Did everyone see that?

00:03:01.926 --> 00:03:04.581
She said she was having fun.
Johnny's blowing it.

00:03:04.755 --> 00:03:07.889
She's biking and mini-marting.
She's gonna wanna move!

00:03:08.063 --> 00:03:10.761
I gotta fix this kid now.
Are we almost there or what?

00:03:10.935 --> 00:03:12.720
GRIFFIN:
[NERVOUS CHUCKLE] Okay, I may

00:03:12.894 --> 00:03:14.374
have taken a wrong
turn a few miles back.

00:03:14.548 --> 00:03:16.289
Don't get mad. What?

00:03:18.508 --> 00:03:20.554
Someone turn on
the navigator on this thing.

00:03:20.728 --> 00:03:22.599
Look how light
I touch it. [CELL PHONE BEEPS]

00:03:22.773 --> 00:03:25.559
NAVIGATOR VOICE:
Please enter your destination.

00:03:25.733 --> 00:03:29.302
Please. I am begging you.

00:03:32.043 --> 00:03:34.394
Yeah, this is gonna
be good, Denisovich.

00:03:34.568 --> 00:03:37.353
Scary stuff, okay?
It's in you.

00:03:37.527 --> 00:03:40.182
We just gotta
concentrate on the scary.

00:03:40.356 --> 00:03:43.011
Papa Drac?
Do you miss Grandma?

00:03:43.185 --> 00:03:45.840
Miss Grandma?
Oh. Sure, I do.

00:03:46.014 --> 00:03:50.236
I miss her every day.
She was my zing.

00:03:51.193 --> 00:03:52.586
Why do you ask?

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:54.022
I don't know.

00:03:54.196 --> 00:03:56.067
Do you miss anybody?

00:03:56.242 --> 00:03:58.287
I miss Mommy and Daddy.

00:03:58.461 --> 00:04:01.159
And who else?
You miss that Winnie?

00:04:01.334 --> 00:04:04.250
The pup who tackles you
and tries to lick
you all the time?

00:04:04.424 --> 00:04:06.556
Yeah, but we're
just friends.

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:09.472
Oh, no, no, no.
You're a Dracula.

00:04:09.646 --> 00:04:13.346
You can't just be friends
with a cute,
hairy number like Winnie.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:19.003
NAVIGATOR VOICE:
Right turn, now!
Here. You imbecile!

00:04:19.177 --> 00:04:20.091
Oh, right. Turn, Griffin!

00:04:20.266 --> 00:04:21.397
Yes, Papa Drac.

00:04:26.576 --> 00:04:31.277
Wait and see, fellas.
This kid'll be guzzling
goat blood in no time.

00:04:31.451 --> 00:04:34.671
NAVIGATOR VOICE:
You have arrived
at your destination. Yes!

00:04:34.845 --> 00:04:36.586
Yes! Here we are.

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:38.980
It's the vampire summer camp
I went to as a kid.

00:04:39.154 --> 00:04:41.461
What's it, Camp Vamp?

00:04:41.635 --> 00:04:43.550
No. Who names
their camp "Camp Vamp?"

00:04:43.724 --> 00:04:45.900
It's Camp Winnepacaca.

00:05:03.613 --> 00:05:04.527
[GIGGLING]

00:05:06.486 --> 00:05:08.139
You see, Denisovich?

00:05:08.314 --> 00:05:12.318
This is where I learned
to catch mice and shapeshift.

00:05:12.492 --> 00:05:15.930
And use my incredible
powers and strength.
It's pretty cool. Huh?

00:05:16.104 --> 00:05:16.974
Badminton.

00:05:17.627 --> 00:05:18.541
[GRUNTING]

00:05:21.718 --> 00:05:24.895
Yes, I don't
remember this badminting.

00:05:25.069 --> 00:05:27.942
Well, well, is this a night?
How ya doin', folks?

00:05:28.116 --> 00:05:29.944
I'm Dana, the director.

00:05:30.118 --> 00:05:32.294
We're sure excited
to have you
legends visitin' us.

00:05:32.468 --> 00:05:34.731
What can I do you for?

00:05:34.905 --> 00:05:39.170
Well, I'm very interested
in sending my grandboy,
Denisovich, here.

00:05:39.345 --> 00:05:43.740
Oh. This little redheaded,
non-fangy little guy?

00:05:43.914 --> 00:05:47.265
Oh, they're in there.
He's a late fanger.
That's why we came here.

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:49.485
Can you show us
some of the drills,

00:05:49.659 --> 00:05:51.618
like where they
catch the mice?

00:05:51.792 --> 00:05:54.664
Can do.
A-course now we
call it Tee-Mousing.

00:05:57.493 --> 00:05:58.407
[SQUEAKING]

00:06:00.627 --> 00:06:01.541
[CHUCKLING]

00:06:05.806 --> 00:06:08.199
So they don't have
to catch the mice?

00:06:08.374 --> 00:06:11.725
Nope.
We find this is a good way
to build their confidence.

00:06:13.553 --> 00:06:14.641
Come here.

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:17.644
It's right there!
What's the matter with you?

00:06:19.472 --> 00:06:20.690
Hokey-pokey.

00:06:22.344 --> 00:06:23.998
Ah!

00:06:24.172 --> 00:06:27.262
There it is, Denisovich.
Where Papa learned to fly.

00:06:27.436 --> 00:06:29.307
Ooh! I wanna fly like Papa.

00:06:29.482 --> 00:06:30.483
[CREAKING]

00:06:34.878 --> 00:06:35.966
Uh...

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:37.794
Yeah. We're over here, now.

00:06:39.187 --> 00:06:41.711
Had to scale it down.
Insurance.

00:06:44.192 --> 00:06:45.323
[GROANS]

00:06:45.498 --> 00:06:47.674
Help me. Help me. Help me.

00:06:47.848 --> 00:06:50.720
Hokey-pokey.
See ya at the campfire.

00:06:52.505 --> 00:06:53.201
[DOORBELL DINGS]

00:06:55.638 --> 00:06:58.162
Well, gosh! Welcome, you two.

00:06:58.336 --> 00:06:59.381
Hey, gang.

00:06:59.555 --> 00:07:02.384
Hi, guys. This is so exciting.

00:07:02.558 --> 00:07:06.562
Ah!
Look at all of this. So cool.

00:07:06.736 --> 00:07:09.130
Wow! I can't
believe I'm actually here.

00:07:09.304 --> 00:07:11.437
Well, you are.

00:07:11.611 --> 00:07:13.830
Now, how does it work?
Are you up all
night and sleep all day?

00:07:14.004 --> 00:07:15.266
Yeah.

00:07:15.441 --> 00:07:16.311
Oh. I'll do
whatever you guys want.

00:07:16.485 --> 00:07:18.313
Good.

00:07:18.487 --> 00:07:20.576
'Cause I bought this
pretty sunhat for you. Linda.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:22.578
But otherwise this poncho,
if you wanna be safe.

00:07:22.752 --> 00:07:24.362
We can deal with
it later, Linda.

00:07:24.537 --> 00:07:25.363
Okay.

00:07:25.538 --> 00:07:27.235
Oh! Come see.

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:29.977
I've set up your bedroom.

00:07:30.151 --> 00:07:30.891
[EVIL LAUGHTER]

00:07:34.068 --> 00:07:37.114
It's just like Transylvania.

00:07:37.288 --> 00:07:40.683
Oh, Transylvania.
That was a fun experience.

00:07:40.857 --> 00:07:42.772
Mike was afraid he'd get
disemboweled and eaten,

00:07:42.946 --> 00:07:44.818
but I told him he
was just being silly.

00:07:44.992 --> 00:07:46.123
That was you, Linda. [DOORBELL DINGS]

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:49.213
Oh. There they are.

00:07:49.387 --> 00:07:51.607
You know, we have a couple
of mixed families
in the neighborhood,

00:07:51.781 --> 00:07:53.609
so I thought I'd
invite them over.

00:07:53.783 --> 00:07:55.698
They might be nice
for you guys to talk to

00:07:55.872 --> 00:07:57.526
since you're
thinkin' about moving here.

